          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td
              class="py-2.5 px-3 font-semibold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400"
              >Overweight</td
            >
            <td class="py-2.5 px-3">25.0 – 29.9</td>
            <td class="py-2.5 px-3">23.0 – 24.9</td>
            <td class="py-2.5 px-3"
              >Moderate risk of type-2 diabetes & hypertension</td
            >
          </tr>
          <tr>
