            >BMI = Weight (kg) / (Height in m)²</code
          >. Adding your age and sex allows our calculator to estimate your body
          fat % and ideal weight.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details
        class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4 dark:border-slate-800"
